**Verdict:** 2.5ct marquise sits in the strong value spot. 10% more face-up area than 2ct for 25% more natural price. 7% less face-up than 3ct for 60% less natural price. The sweet spot of the premium tiers. Full tier breakdown in our [marquise cut diamond size chart](/marquise-cut-diamond-size-chart).

